<fo:block id="W0063-01-0220-pa-0ffa" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-size="12pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm" id="W0063-01-0220-re-17e7"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0063-01-0220-re-0c81" color="#0a0c75">e</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> ¶ <fo:inline font-style="italic">Por aluedrio.</fo:inline> Ita etiam dixit glo. &amp; approbat ibi Abb. in cap. potuit<fo:inline> </fo:inline>de locato in verbo celeri.</fo:block>
