<fo:block id="W0063-01-0263-pa-11be" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="bold" font-size="12pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm" id="W0063-01-0263-re-1965"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0063-01-0264-re-0dff" color="#0a0c75">l</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> ¶ <fo:inline font-style="italic">En culpa.</fo:inline> Concor. cum dictis glo. in. d.c. <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i qua monacharum.</fo:block>
